  "summary": "Malicious code in bdmbet-online (npm)",
  "details": "Bdmbet-online@1.0.0 is an inert casino-affiliate spam package. Its index.js exports an empty object and it declares no lifecycle scripts, no binaries, and no dependencies. The package ships only a French-language README of promotional SEO copy for \"BDM Bet Casino\" that links to bdm-bet-casino[.]fr and embeds a typeform-hosted image. It is a content-only package with no executable payload, no network activity, and no credential handling — its purpose is to seed casino-affiliate marketing content into the npm registry.",
